  "description": "Eight years after breaking up with her first love, she thought the best revenge was to live well and became an entertainment Producer.  \nThe first love, 'Handam', who disappeared after a 10-year relationship, has returned to Dolsing.  \nThat too. With the 'Dolsing Love Program' I planned?!  \nIt's a realistic romance drama about 30-somethings who experience troubles and frustrations in love and romance, marriage and divorce, romance and reality.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=817049), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10211003)",
